This <University of Oxford> Part C paper combines Analytic <Topology> in section A and Axiomatic <Set> Theory in section B, cross-listed for Mathematics, Mathematics and Computer Science, and Mathematics and Philosophy. https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_past_papers_3[Source release]{ref} The archive retains the complete editable four-page transcription. Bounded official-source searches found no advertised answers for this exact paper. The solution to A1(iv) replaces a faulty printed radial hint with a proved rectangular construction.

